Schema migrations for the Weavance API.

Run these commands from `apps/api`. They prefer an active virtual environment and otherwise use
the project's `.venv`.

Create a reviewed migration after changing the SQLAlchemy model:

    uv run --active alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"

Apply all migrations:

    uv run --active alembic upgrade head

Migration files are historical artifacts. Keep values needed to reproduce a migration inside that
migration rather than importing mutable application constants. Review autogenerated operations
before committing them.
